SUMMARY:It Was Just An Accident
DTSTART:20251111T001500Z
DTEND:20251111T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20251111T001500Z
UID:rwgfWQPe6T
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 105 mins (1h45m)\n\nWinner of this year’s Palme d
 ’Or at Cannes\, the latest from Iranian auteur Jafar Panahi — his firs
 t following his most recent prison sentence — follows a group of citizen
 s pondering revenge against a man they believe was their torturer.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/it-was-just-an-accident\n\nEstimated s
 tart: 16:30
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
